{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[G]Tonight I'm sad my heart is [C]lonely
[D]Wondering if I'm wrong or [G]right
[G]To think about you though you've [C]left me
I [D]wonder where you are [G]tonight
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[C]The old rain is cold and slowly [G]falling
[G]Upon my window pane [D]tonight
And [G]though your love was even [C]colder
I [D]wonder where you are [G]tonight
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
Your heart was cold you never loved me
Though you often said you cared
But now you've gone to find another
Someone who'll know the love we've shared
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
Then came the dawn the day you left me
I tried to smile with all my might
But you could see the pain within me
That lingers in my heart tonight
{end_of_chorus}
